WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.157
A fɔra ko sanjiba dɔ nana tuma min na, mɔgɔ minw tun sɛgɛnna, olu tun be yaala ka jii ɲini jamana yɔrɔ bɛɛ.

00:00:09.237 --> 00:00:13.647
U y'a fɔ ko jɛgɛw le y'u minɛ ka taga n'u ye jii la.

00:00:13.727 --> 00:00:19.345
O cɛɛw y'a daa di ko u tɛna foyi kɛ u la walisa k'u waleɲuman lɔn.

00:00:19.425 --> 00:00:23.143
Kabi o tuma, o layidu be to ka kɛ sariya ye.
